              "blocks": {
                "text_tR7mNx": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Our collections feature pieces dipped in a heavy layer of <strong>24K gold</strong> or finished in <strong>silver tone</strong>, crafted from high-quality brass. We also offer <strong>sterling silver</strong> and <strong>full gold</strong> pieces in our premium lines. All our jewelry is nickel-free. For specific material details, please check the product description on each item\u2019s page.</p>",
